@title AddNames
 @notice Adds the on-chain pseudos (ADR 0022) to a running deployment: deploys Names behind a proxy, lets the
         operator relay signed pseudos and reserves "V" and "SYSTEM". A fresh deployment does not need this:
         script/Deploy.s.sol does it.
 @dev Environment: ADMIN_ADDRESS (current admin, signs), UPGRADER_ADDRESS, OPERATOR_ADDRESS.
